  << /ActualText (Below the Top Bar\054 a primary summary card is displayed\056 This card presents weekly statistics for the currently active metric\056 The card provides a quick overview of overall progress for the selected week\056\nThe Top Summary Card displays\072\nthe name of the active metric \050Steps \057 Calories \057 Minutes \057 Kilometers\051\073\na primary numeric value representing the total value for the selected week\073\na secondary text label in the format\072 Daily average\072 X\054 where the unit depends on the active metric\072\nSteps \024 steps\nCalories \024 kcal\nTime \024 min\nDistance \024 km\nWhen the active metric is changed via the bottom tab bar\072\nthe content of the Top Summary Card updates immediately\073\nnumeric formatting and units adjust according to the selected metric\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
