4291 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Week Selector is located below the Top Summary Card and is used to navigate between weekly reports\056\nThe selector consists of the following elements\072\na previous week button \050left arrow\051\073\na date range label in the format\072 Nov 16 \023 Nov 22\073\na next week button \050right arrow\051\056\nWeek Selector Behavior\nBy default\054 the current week is selected\056\nTapping the previous week button\072\nnavigates to the previous calendar week\073\nupdates the data shown in the Top Summary Card\073\nupdates the list of days for the selected week\056)
