4305 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This section displays a detailed breakdown of activity data for each day of the selected week\056\nStructure\nThe list always contains 7 items\054 one for each day of the week \050Monday \222 Sunday\051\056\nDays are ordered chronologically within the selected week\056\nEach list item represents one calendar day\056\nThe weekly list is scrollable\056\nDay Item Content\nEach day item includes\072\nDay name \050e\056g\056 Monday\054 Tuesday\051\056\nPrimary value based on the currently active metric\nUnit corresponding to the active metric\056\nA status icon displayed in the top\055right corner of the item\056\nStatus Icons\nEach day item displays a status icon that reflects its state\072\n\023 Check icon \023 shown for completed past days that have recorded data\056\nR Clock icon \023 shown for the current day of the current week and indicates that this day is still in progress\056\n\023 Minus icon \023 shown for inactive days with no available data\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 4306 0 R
     /Pg 2180 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

