4315 0 obj
  << /ActualText (No Data State\nIf there is no data available for a given day\054 the item is displayed in an inactive state\056\nThis may occur when\072\nthe day has not occurred yet \050future days within the selected week\051\054 or\nthe app was installed mid\055week\054 and no historical data exists for earlier days\056\nIn this case\072\nthe primary value is shown as 0\054\na \034No data\035 label is displayed\054\nthe item appears visually muted to indicate inactivity\056\nThe \034No data\035 label is shown consistently for all metrics\056\nActive Day Highlight\nThe current day \050if it belongs to the selected week\051 is visually highlighted\056\nThis helps the user quickly identify today\031s activity within the weekly context\056\nInteraction Behavior\nDay items are not interactive\056\nThe list is intended for read\055only overview of weekly data\056\nUpdate Behavior\nThe weekly list updates automatically when\072\nthe active metric is changed via the bottom tab bar\054\nthe selected week is changed using the week selector\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 4316 0 R
     /Pg 2661 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

