  << /ActualText (Impact on Report Screen Content\nWhen the user selects a different tab\072\nTop Summary Card updates immediately\072\nthe metric title changes\073\nthe primary value \050weekly total\051 updates\073\nthe Daily Average value and its unit update accordingly\056\nWeekly Breakdown List updates\072\ndaily values reflect the selected metric\073\nadditional elements appear or disappear depending on the metric \050for example\054 Goal is shown only for Steps\051\056\nWeek Selector remains unchanged and keeps the currently selected week\056\nAll visible data on the screen always corresponds to the currently active metric\056\nNavigation Behavior\nSwitching tabs\072\ndoes not open a new screen\073\ntriggers an immediate in\055place content update\056\nThe selected tab remains active until another tab is chosen\056\nLayout and Scrolling\nBottom Metric Tabs are fixed to the bottom of the screen\056\nThey do not scroll with the content\056\nOnly the Weekly Breakdown List is scrollable\056\nThe Top Summary Card and Week Selector remain visible while scrolling the list\056\nDefault State\nWhen the Report screen is opened for the first time\054 Steps is selected by default\056\nAll Report screen components are initialized using the Steps metric\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
