  << /ActualText (This document describes the requirements for the fourth development milestone \050Milestone \0434\051 of the Smart Step application\056\nMilestone \0434 focuses on introducing weekly activity reports and detailed analytics views\056 At this stage\054 the application is extended with a dedicated Weekly Activity Report screen that allows users to review their activity data by week\054 switch between different metrics \050Steps\054 Calories\054 Time\054 Distance\051\054 and better understand trends and progress over time\056 This milestone builds on the tracking\054 metrics\054 and AI\055driven insights introduced in the previous milestones\056\nThe mockups define the overall appearance and expected behavior of the interface\056 Specific technical decisions \050component structure\054 state handling\054 animation implementation\051 are left to the participants\054 as long as the final result follows the described logic and interaction patterns\056\nYou can find the Smart Step mockups here\072)
     /K [ 3 ]
